00px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/92b924be-873e-4dc6-a0c2-485430923cf2" alt="A smiling man with short brown hair and a beard wearing a blue, white, and red racing suit." class="r-g25f5v" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="6764263c-b98d-416b-a227-47dac2ff8fa9" class="r-lz6cn0"><div data-rid="863d0674-03ec-41a1-a60a-79a8dee566c1" class="r-rnn0tu"><div data-rid="3fb4b978-7b59-4d3d-af8b-eb40df8b7ac5" class="r-1u3m0fy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Chad Finchum</p></span></div><picture data-rid="621fbd24-ac78-4000-9149-e658b3a7cd68" class="r-bg9uvn"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/86e5ae55-b5aa-4e49-a473-588a4617b451?width=60" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/86e5ae55-b5aa-4e49-a473-588a4617b451?width=60" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/86e5ae55-b5aa-4e49-a473-588a4617b451?width=60" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/86e5ae55-b5aa-4e49-a473-588a4617b451" class="r-xb4ta0" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div data-rid="6aed715b-45a1-4e48-9f5b-50d44fb08169" class="r-1vwwr3h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>NASCAR Driver</p></span></div><div data-rid="59731e5f-7255-469b-b16b-1b079318ced7" class="r-jngc8l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Performance & recovery</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0a629cd0-d33d-47b7-a292-3057bd589877" class="r-1nrgqyp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Better materials. Cleaner sleep. A pillow built for people who expect more from their recovery.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="94972024-f0cd-4cf7-a256-6844a9da0b3c" class="r-1em2oq1"><div data-rid="9ac8f67b-b045-444d-a355-4fe406211fc3" class="r-1shvyqq"><div data-rid="c5afe831-0e78-4943-9902-efe544c3c1bd" class="r-81l73h"><div data-rid="f9e3c42b-0067-406c-bf6d-e49286a7d4d4" class="r-jjnbat alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Questions?</strong> We have answers!</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="d7111b77-8d10-45ff-953b-3a35dda39391" class="r-19uzm8y" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ceaf9c0f-bf94-4f19-a7ad-cde2354adb3f" class="r-35kzh7" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="55eb53f4-fc6f-4ab2-8ff8-caaf56c58e73" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-17bl80q"><div data-rid="b53c4277-1173-4882-94f0-f995257cf9fa" class="r-lax9ay alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is the Organic Snooze Kloud Pillow and what makes it different from a regular pillow?</p></span></div><div data-rid="73a8e630-a000-4259-bccb-ddf4120e0da3" class="r-puuft2" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-7rkbwl" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3bj2:"><div data-rid="c09ed4fa-f588-45a2-b603-9807a618d2f3" class="r-bisydw"><div data-rid="80a0486a-0075-400d-8764-459362487f2d" class="r-11knekd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most pillows are filled with synthetic polyester, memory foam, or down alternatives that compress over time, trap heat, and offer either too much softness or too much firmness. The Organic Snooze Kloud Pillow uses a 50/50 blend of Organic Kapok and Shredded Organic Latex, two naturally sourced materials that work together to give you cloud-like softness and real neck support at the same time. There are no synthetic foams, no chemical fillers, and no compromises on what goes inside.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c4a97bc4-9ab0-49fc-9c95-4c319c6b3284" class="r-98wy80" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c2aec35e-d85a-419b-b1b6-d3e11ea93f7d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1k72mfg"><div data-rid="07c43a8e-be11-4dd0-9ba8-382b906264db" class="r-1aui1v8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How should I care for my organic pillows?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5a01eed7-74b7-43a9-aa74-c63c3593c9fb" class="r-4zacag" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1ejoqps" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5bj2:"><div data-rid="99d7c5a0-53c8-44e3-98fb-4655e714b499" class="r-955lrb"><div data-rid="9a970857-2a8e-45c4-9f35-478b8304cc6c" class="r-f0jqv6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The natural materials used in our pillows naturally help manage moisture and resist odor buildup. Machine washing the pillow itself is not recommended, as it can damage these materials. Instead, placing the pillow in dry sunlight and fresh air will help refresh the natural fibers. The organic cotton cover can be washed in cold water and air dried for regular cleaning.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2db06b71-06b7-43d3-b5a2-76c9bfd39f51" class="r-3ccqtk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="2fc21053-3276-4bfc-a197-62ec67790843" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-19s7vza"><div data-rid="24abbf82-01df-4b8d-8d14-dbf58fe763b4" class="r-1mj9k0a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is Organic Kapok and why is it used in this pillow?</p></span></div><div data-rid="33f6f89e-424b-4d6c-b76c-497a5ae8c2e9" class="r-b2gi51" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1k7lxqb" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7bj2:"><div data-rid="50e52f8a-aaeb-4288-8c3e-8006bca797b1" class="r-15mhcbb"><div data-rid="57e0bb41-2db2-4980-9312-deea01ec7d30" class="r-170gd7j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Organic Kapok is a natural fiber harvested from the seed pods of the Kapok tree. It is one of the lightest natural fibers in the world, which gives it an exceptionally airy, cloud-like feel that synthetic fills try to replicate but cannot match. Organic Kapok is also naturally breathable and temperature-neutral, meaning it does not trap heat against your head the way polyester or foam tends to. In the Kloud Pillow, Organic Kapok provides the soft, billowy loft that makes the pillow feel immediately comfortable from the first night.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="94a2ceae-d766-4037-b248-9f0f4ae8a1eb" class="r-kw04vt" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="763ce43c-3fe2-4044-8719-943667d226cf" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-7d6o2p"><div data-rid="d1cbebf6-29e1-483d-8513-02835a665dbf" class="r-k04ger alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why is Shredded Organic Latex added to the blend?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c427d71d-ba1b-4362-afc4-da490facf1d0" class="r-gz5w7k" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-2v2l1y" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9bj2:"><div data-rid="87106f9a-5f0d-4278-9524-c7bb1278a72d" class="r-1aulj47"><div data-rid="26179e31-f5fc-4c32-8a8c-6fe622cd50fa" class="r-1bzxkgg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Softness alone does not make a great pillow. Without some structure, your head sinks too far down, your neck loses alignment, and you wake up with tension in your shoulders and upper back.</p><br><p>The Shredded Organic Latex in the Kloud Pillow adds just enough gentle responsiveness to keep your head and neck properly supported through the night without making the pillow feel stiff or dense.</p><br><p>The Shredded Organic Latex also has a natural bounce-back quality that helps the pillow hold its shape over time, so it does not go flat the way down or polyester pillows do.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="60854597-e27c-4a3f-8fd0-26dce14a0f57" class="r-17nuc56" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="5791dc13-6406-4f73-bea2-6ea1560bbce3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbbj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1y6a6fj"><div data-rid="5a783900-24c9-41c6-909d-b481860ed773" class="r-1kx0074 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Will this pillow sleep cool or does it retain heat?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ed67b0c0-19be-4649-9bf9-d943771d2b8b" class="r-14ygqli" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-6gw02u" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbbj2:"><div data-rid="53c943d2-6d1c-483d-b307-c323152cb0ff" class="r-1prprrc"><div data-rid="fc27340b-0b54-490a-8c94-ee3151b814aa" class="r-x987al alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Kloud Pillow sleeps cool by design. Organic Kapok is inherently breathable and does not have the dense, closed structure of foam that traps body heat. Shredded Organic Latex, as opposed to solid latex, also allows for air movement through the fill. The combination means heat dissipates rather than builds up around your head, which supports the natural drop in core body temperature your body needs to reach and sustain deep sleep.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="623e4d01-3bf0-4729-b1f8-1fac204aada9" class="r-1o4xxiv" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0357553e-f9f0-4015-a2fe-64c3489083d1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rdbj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1wvntkh"><div data-rid="73905ef5-23da-4883-b8fb-2da8e85bf044" class="r-8hw0o6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Kloud Pillow good for side sleepers?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c84dea65-118c-43db-8ee4-40df02b9ecac" class="r-3r47th" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-osaavt" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rdbj2:"><div data-rid="e85af302-8388-4f31-af08-d78b052a3413" class="r-1rvxezs"><div data-rid="642915b7-916a-4a2f-a26b-d35a1d22558b" class="r-1mwv1ke alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. The Kloud's 50/50 Organic Kapok and Shredded Organic Latex blend provides a responsive, pressure-relieving loft that works well for side sleepers. It is also fully adjustable — remove some fill to dial in the exact height and softness you prefer.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9a11a38b-dbc7-4f68-9915-4f3720650822" class="r-40g9rp" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c7f286cb-f083-42b6-9a16-033be854b057" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rfbj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1mos5d1"><div data-rid="b22bf5bf-36ef-4e6e-ae99-eb938cb8ab54" class="r-5aftr3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do the pillows come with a warranty or trial period?</p></span></div><div data-rid="da1f017c-fe1e-4c12-ae99-2dd57639f01e" class="r-1y80npq" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-18lsnuo" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rfbj2:"><div data-rid="7bd84924-30e8-4106-bbe1-c53542be2639" class="r-1tb08wn"><div data-rid="57719709-ddab-48b6-a39a-fb2edbc905c5" class="r-rou39c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every pillow ships with an organic pillow protector included at no extra cost. The protector is your first line of defense — it guards against stains, rips, and spills and is machine washable (air dry or low heat). For return eligibility, please refer to our 30-day accessory return policy.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="529299e2-ad00-4462-b749-9c4cfdb82b06" class="r-fw71o3" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="2ad4fe19-251b-4b96-95e4-141638646fb0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rhbj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1uopkhz"><div data-rid="a123758f-52f1-4ec8-8701-ef5aa9ff5301" class="r-10x11ed alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is the difference between the Kloud Pillow, Dual-Sided Pillow, and Signature Pillow?</p></span></div><div data-rid="9e674547-c44e-402c-8df7-cb372ab729dc" class="r-8nqit4" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-11dre66" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rhbj2:"><div data-rid="df4da132-b977-4aaa-a0f7-0fecef9bc0db" class="r-lzytcn"><div data-rid="58096843-3764-4f5d-add6-b06739856f1c" class="r-1powy9t alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Kloud Pillow: A 50/50 blend of Organic Kapok and Shredded Organic Latex in a cotton sateen casing — soft, cloud-like feel that is fully adjustable.</p><br><p>Dual-Sided Pillow: Two chambers with different fillings — one side is 100% organic wool (firm, temperature-regulating), the other is 100% Shredded Organic Latex (plush and supportive). Flip between sides based on your preference.</p><br><p>Signature Organic Cotton Pillows: Filled with 100% organic cotton — a classic, natural feel available in multi-packs.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f04f91e3-970c-4ddd-9815-e004833dfc01" class="r-1crf93q"><button data-rid="e1d4fbd5-a92b-495b-ba2d-c7bd6dc1708d" tabindex="0" class="text r-19taoj8 alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="8a94878e-cef8-4f10-9d40-32c24679d882" class="r-1yaklje alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>ORDER Kloud Pillow Now</p></span></div></button></div><div data-rid="38fc4ba5-8b6d-466f-a2fb-2c6c3f9f802c" class="r-1iym9oh"><picture data-rid="64dcd357-bb7a-463f-a091-fa91b8cbb6f3" class="r-1m5lhxm"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/6248a5c3-b0e2-43d5-8dd0-a29554027d1e?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/6248a5c3-b0e2-43d5-8dd0-a29554027d1e?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/6248a5c3-b0e2-43d5-8dd0-a29554027d1e?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/6248a5c3-b0e2-43d5-8dd0-a29554027d1e" class="r-1jv06mp" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="b5673627-43e8-40bf-aedd-5d41f840e10c" class="r-1w915vy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Need More Help?</p></span></div><a data-rid="4827a4fa-9fb5-4683-9a45-0bc4b8c9cf8e" tabindex="0" class="r-1sgj3sp alchemy-rte" target="_top" href="https://theultimatesnooze.com/pages/contact"><p>Contact Us</p></a></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950&family=Poppins:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950&display=swap)</style></div>
